1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:38,920
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,040
My Lord, General Qi is here.

4
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:55,800
Did you find anything last night?

5
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:58,520
I couldn't find Jin Chang,
the man Wei Rao mentioned,

6
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:00,120
in the prison last night.

7
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,840
But I found relatives
of the abducted girls.

8
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:05,640
Right, and a clerk
from the Court of Justice too.

9
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:07,400
Outraged by what had happened,

10
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:10,160
he submitted petitions for the victims
and was imprisoned too.

11
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,080
Can he testify?

12
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:19,400
They cut out his tongue
and severed all four limbs,

13
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:20,840
tortured him beyond recognition.

14
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:25,320
I only learned who he was
by questioning others.

15
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:27,760
How cruel.

16
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:30,080
I heard bandits raided
the Crown Prince's Residence.

17
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,400
Was it Wei Rao…?

18
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,280
It really was her?

19
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,240
Heavens.

20
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:41,200
This is bad.
The Crown Prince won't let this slide.

21
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,800
What are we going to do?

22
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,920
My Lord, the Northern Army
has searched everywhere

23
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,320
and found nothing.

24
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,080
Nothing at all?

25
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:54,160
That's even stranger.

26
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,560
Where could they have hidden those girls?

27
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,520
Why don't you ask her yourself?

28
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,920
- Right! I'll go to Zhuyu Estate now…
- No need.

29
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,400
She's here.

30
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,080
What do you mean?

31
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:14,800
Haven't you heard?

32
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:16,440
Last night,

33
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:19,600
the Northern Army searched my room
and disturbed Noble Lady Wu'an.

34
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:21,560
By noon,

35
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,360
the whole capital will probably know.

36
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,560
CROWN PRINCE'S RESIDENCE

37
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,560
You found nothing?

38
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:31,080
We began at Your Highness's residence

39
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:32,600
and searched all the way
to the outer city.

40
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,960
We even searched
the Eldest Princess's residence,

41
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,840
but found no sign
of the wounded ringleader.

42
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:39,040
Bandits broke into our residence
and abducted concubines and maids,

43
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,200
yet you caught no one.

44
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:42,440
Did they all vanish into thin air?

45
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,800
His Majesty issued a decree of grace,

46
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:44,920
opening Guangbu Ward,

47
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,400
Jingji Ward, and other areas
to displaced people.

48
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,880
The authorities serve congee once a day.

49
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:52,200
But to make a living,
most refugees work as day laborers or beg.

50
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:54,480
The bandits are hiding among them.
It's hard to tell them apart.

51
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,320
Last night, we blocked every route
from this residence out of the city,

52
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,880
with checkpoints set
throughout the wards and at the gates.

53
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:02,040
But we had to withdraw
our sentries at dawn

54
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,080
so the refugees could seek a livelihood.

55
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:05,640
Otherwise, unrest could've drawn
His Majesty's attention,

56
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:07,360
leading to unthinkable consequences.

57
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,800
We beg Your Highness
for a little more time

58
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:11,280
to investigate discreetly.

59
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:12,680
Investigate…

60
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:15,600
By the time you're done,
the bandits will have been long gone!

61
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,800
Enough!

62
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:20,880
- Leave me.
- Your Highness…

63
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:31,200
Don't be angry, Your Highness.

64
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:32,680
Let me attend to you.

65
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:34,960
Get out!

66
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,640
Don't be angry, Your Highness.

67
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:42,960
I won't come in.
You must take care of yourself.

68
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:46,480
- The bandits will surely be caught.
- Useless!

69
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,880
You're all useless!

70
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,160
Your Highness!

71
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,880
His Majesty summons you at once.

72
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,040
Your Highness,

73
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:04,840
His Majesty must have heard about the raid
and must be concerned for your safety.

74
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:09,680
Help me up.

75
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,280
Yes.

76
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,640
I don't want your help!

77
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,800
‪RADIANT CLARITY

78
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,880
SIMA GATE

79
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:27,440
Your Majesty!

80
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,880
We've been wronged!

81
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,480
Your Highness.

82
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:35,280
Who are these people
wailing outside the palace entrance?

83
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:40,000
Please show us justice!

84
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:44,480
- Help us, Your Majesty!
- Help us, Your Majesty!

85
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:51,680
- Please, save us, Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

86
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:55,000
Lord Wang, last night,
a carriage stopped at the palace entrance.

87
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:58,600
When the Imperial Guards came up,
many young women stepped out.

88
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:01,680
They were said to have been abducted
by someone powerful.

89
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:05,640
They wept so bitterly
that His Majesty himself was alerted.

90
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,960
Nothing like this
has ever happened before!

91
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,360
His Majesty just summoned
the Commandant of Justice

92
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,360
and gave him a furious scolding.

93
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:14,160
Then the Commandant named someone.

94
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:16,480
- Do you know who it was?
- Who? Who?

95
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:21,320
Come on, let's go. Time for court.

96
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:22,440
Your Majesty!

97
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:27,240
Give us justice, Your Majesty!

98
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:32,000
Give us justice!

99
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:34,520
Justice, Your Majesty!

100
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:36,000
- Hurry.
- Okay.

101
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:38,160
‪SIMA GATE

102
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:41,040
‪RED-AND-BLACK PAINTED WOODWORK

103
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:41,960
Don't be afraid.

104
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,160
The Northern Army is busy hunting bandits.

105
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:46,320
The Crown Prince's residence
and his other estate are both on fire.

106
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:47,960
His household is too busy saving itself.

107
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:50,040
Besides, so what if they do catch up?

108
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:52,440
You're not slaves,
and you've committed no crime.

109
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:53,600
They have no grounds to arrest you.

110
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:56,760
Why isn't the carriage
heading out of the city?

111
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:58,880
Where are we going to hide?

112
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:02,400
If my family knows I escaped
from the Crown Prince's residence,

113
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,640
they wouldn't dare to keep me.

114
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:07,240
To get home safely,
you need only remember one thing.

115
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:10,880
When I take you
to our destination, just cry.

116
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:12,120
Cry out loud.

117
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:13,720
The louder, the better.

118
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,480
Cry?

119
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:23,520
Crying in front of the person hurting you

120
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,960
only adds to his pleasure
in bullying the weak.

121
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:28,920
But if you cry in the right place,

122
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:31,800
loudly enough for the Emperor
and the whole world to hear,

123
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:34,760
and strike fear
into the man behind it all,

124
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:38,560
will he still risk universal condemnation
and pursue you?

125
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,680
Even if he wants revenge,

126
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:44,520
he'll have to consider
how secure his own position is.

127
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:52,080
If one day
the Crown Prince takes the throne,

128
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:55,000
he'll have his pick of
all the women in the realm.

129
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,840
Who will care
whether those women were willing?

130
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:02,080
The law applies to commoners,

131
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:04,920
not princes.

132
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,560
XUANSHI PALACE

133
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,800
Attendant Zheng,

134
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:21,080
please plead my case before Father.

135
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,400
I've been falsely accused.

136
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,320
Your Highness,

137
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:28,200
those women wept loudly outside the palace
and alerted His Majesty.

138
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:29,920
His Majesty ordered me to ask them,

139
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:32,120
and certain unseemly words came to light.

140
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:34,120
His Majesty was furious.

141
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:37,039
Anyone who tried to send word
to your household

142
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,840
was given 80 strokes of the rod.

143
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:40,919
By merely ordering you to kneel here,

144
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:44,440
His Majesty has shown exceptional mercy
because you are his own flesh and blood.

145
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,960
He's committed so many crimes.

146
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:50,640
Everyone else has been punished,

147
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:53,960
yet he, the chief culprit,
need only kneel here.

148
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:57,920
It's so unfair to the girls
whose families he destroyed.

149
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:01,800
In affairs of state, the Crown Prince
has made no major mistakes.

150
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:04,400
Even if he's gone
a bit too far with women,

151
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:08,040
Father will give him
a light punishment and let it go.

152
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:10,640
After all,
he's the son Father values the most.

153
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:16,840
<i>Father has already lost one son.</i>

154
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:18,320
<i>How could he bear</i>
<i>to lose the Crown Prince too?</i>

155
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,600
- Your Highness!
- Oh no.

156
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:22,520
The Crown Prince
can't hold out any longer.

157
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,320
- I'll go check on him!
- What's it to you?

158
00:09:26,280 --> 00:09:27,360
Shou!

159
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:30,680
Your Highness…

160
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:34,320
Shou. Shou.

161
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:37,760
I'll plead with Father
on your behalf. Wait here.

162
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:41,840
You're a good brother.

163
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,040
I'll remember this favor.

164
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:47,280
We're brothers. No need for thanks.

165
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,840
Take good care of the Crown Prince.

166
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:49,760
Yes.

167
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,760
Sentimental fool.

168
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:03,520
Wei Rao, there are too many eyes
watching in the capital.

169
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:05,320
It'll be hard for you to recover here.

170
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,080
I have a hot spring villa in Yongzhou.

171
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:09,640
It's beautiful and good for healing.

172
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:12,080
Even if the Crown Prince
fears public criticism

173
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:13,520
and dares not search openly,

174
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:15,240
you should still lie low somewhere else.

175
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,920
He's the heir to the throne, after all.

176
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:19,920
So long as His Majesty doesn't depose him,

177
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,440
you must stay on your guard.

178
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,320
You…

179
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:29,680
Wei Rao,
I'll stay with you there for a while.

180
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:31,320
Once things settle down,
you may return to the capital.

181
00:10:31,920 --> 00:10:33,960
- What do you say?
- The carriage is ready.

182
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:35,960
Time to leave.

183
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:39,320
I'll escort you back to the estate.

184
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:41,840
Noble Lady Wu'an spends the night
at the Duke's Residence,

185
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:43,480
then General Qi escorts her home
the next day.

186
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,960
That would set off all sorts of rumors.

187
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,360
You'd better spare her your attentions.

188
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,680
If you truly had her interests at heart,

189
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:54,000
why bring her here
while she was unconscious?

190
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:55,720
You even kept her in your own room

191
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,960
and let so many people see her here.

192
00:10:58,040 --> 00:11:00,200
What, did you think
Wei Rao's reputation was too spotless?

193
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:02,280
This had to be kept secret.

194
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:05,000
My residence was the closest
to the Crown Prince's.

195
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:05,920
Did you expect me

196
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:12,680
to take the injured outside the city?

197
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:15,840
You can spare me
that righteous act of yours.

198
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:18,600
You planned this with an ulterior motive.

199
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,760
Your intentions were never honorable.

200
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:24,120
You two can carry on arguing.

201
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,160
I'm going home.

202
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,040
Thank you for your help, Lord Lu.

203
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:40,760
Attendants!

204
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:00,680
Don't think your careful planning
lets you anticipate everything.

205
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:03,080
She already moved out of your residence.

206
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,760
She won't marry you again.

207
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:09,160
I've made my feelings for Wei Rao clear.

208
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:11,200
I won't bring it up again and annoy her.

209
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:16,480
You shouldn't keep pressuring
or pestering her either.

210
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:20,240
Let her recover in peace.

211
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:23,600
I hope you mean what you say.

212
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:46,880
It was her.

213
00:12:47,920 --> 00:12:49,280
It must be her.

214
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:58,920
Your Highness, the Crown Prince
has returned from the palace.

215
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:20,200
Your Highness.

216
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,360
Didn't you go to the palace?

217
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:30,560
How did you end up in this state?

218
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:33,640
Have they caught anyone?

219
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:35,960
Not yet.

220
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:42,960
Your Highness, I had no solid evidence,

221
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:44,920
so I didn't want to
make unfounded accusations.

222
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:46,800
But the more I think about it,

223
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:49,880
the more suspicious someone seems.

224
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:51,960
Who?

225
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:56,080
There was a wild sparrow locked out back.
Noble Lady Wu'an was her foster sister.

226
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,480
She asked for the girl but failed.

227
00:13:58,560 --> 00:13:59,600
That must have driven her to it.

228
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:05,640
I suspect she took the opportunity
to free the other women as well.

229
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,680
Absurd.

230
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:11,840
Could one woman cause such havoc,

231
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:14,680
then vanish without a trace
despite a citywide search?

232
00:14:15,280 --> 00:14:16,280
But, Your Highness…

233
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,960
Women talk such foolish nonsense!

234
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:19,520
I should never have believed you!

235
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,080
Please calm down, Your Highness.

236
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,480
I let my concern for you cloud my judgment
and jumped to conclusions.

237
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,080
For now, you must focus

238
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:30,920
on your recovery.

239
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:33,040
Catching the culprit

240
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:35,800
- can wait until you get well.
- Get out!

241
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:38,240
Your Highness.

242
00:14:46,680 --> 00:14:47,520
Your Highness…

243
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:53,680
I'll take my leave.

244
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:58,160
UPHOLD VIRTUE AND HONOR TRADITION

245
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:08,360
What's wrong with His Highness?

246
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:10,160
Why is he so angry with you?

247
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:12,040
Something's wrong.

248
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:15,400
Something must have happened
that they're keeping from me.

249
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,320
Have the carriage prepared.

250
00:15:18,400 --> 00:15:21,800
I'll go to Zhuyu Estate myself
and find out.

251
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:24,120
ZHUYU ESTATE

252
00:15:40,880 --> 00:15:42,600
Your Ladyship, the Crown Princess is here.

253
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:52,400
Your Ladyship,
what should we do with Hongxian?

254
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:54,760
I'll take her somewhere to hide.

255
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:55,960
Can she hide for the rest of her life?

256
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:00,080
Come here.

257
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:03,800
Here's what we'll do.

258
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:26,680
I should have prepared a proper welcome
for such an honored guest.

259
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:30,040
But Your Highness gave me no notice,

260
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:31,760
so I'm afraid I've been discourteous.

261
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:33,880
Leave us.

262
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:48,160
I know it was you.

263
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:51,360
Me? What have I done?

264
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:55,960
When you and your Lady Li
drove my mother to hang herself,

265
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:57,040
I forgave you both

266
00:16:57,640 --> 00:17:01,080
because I knew
the greater good had to come first.

267
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:04,400
And how have you repaid me?

268
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:06,520
You acted so recklessly.

269
00:17:06,599 --> 00:17:08,480
Did you ever spare a thought
for the Wei family?

270
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:14,160
Come out.

271
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:37,840
Hongxian, pour Her Highness some tea.

272
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:42,720
I haven't formally introduced her
to Your Highness.

273
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,080
This is my sister,

274
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:47,760
Hongxian.

275
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:57,160
Wei Rao!

276
00:17:58,280 --> 00:18:00,480
How dare you? How could you?

277
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:03,440
We're bound by blood and family.

278
00:18:03,520 --> 00:18:05,760
We should be on the same side,
supporting each other.

279
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:08,480
Yet for someone so lowly, you…

280
00:18:08,560 --> 00:18:10,680
Do people of lowly birth deserve to die?

281
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:21,160
Big fish swallow little fish,
and little fish eat shrimp.

282
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:23,160
The strong devour the weak.

283
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:25,640
That's the way of the world.

284
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:28,600
But for her sake,

285
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:31,600
you defied the Crown Prince.
Such an unforgivable crime.

286
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:33,960
How could you be so foolish?

287
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:37,120
The butcher at the market is lowly.

288
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:38,880
When he sees a noble,

289
00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:42,040
he must crawl on his hands
and knees and kowtow repeatedly.

290
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:45,040
But he has a knife in his hand.

291
00:18:45,760 --> 00:18:47,920
Push him to the limit,

292
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:52,120
and who cares about defying superiors
or offending the highborn?

293
00:18:58,320 --> 00:18:59,760
You lords of privilege,

294
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:02,840
nothing but raw meat
upon the chopping block.

295
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:05,280
What's there to fear?

296
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:08,960
Hongxian, pour another cup.

297
00:19:41,320 --> 00:19:43,000
His Highness, the Crown Prince,

298
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:46,480
will one day ascend the throne,
with the whole realm at his feet.

299
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:48,360
Wei Rao,

300
00:19:49,040 --> 00:19:52,880
you'll regret today's arrogance
when it's too late.

301
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:57,280
What are you laughing at?

302
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:59,800
I'm scared.

303
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:03,400
So scared I'm trembling.

304
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:06,760
Let him become Emperor first.

305
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:08,840
Then he can come and take my head.

306
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:19,320
This matter is far from over.

307
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:24,000
Since we belong to the same clan,
I won't expose you publicly.

308
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:26,480
You'd better watch yourself.

309
00:20:27,720 --> 00:20:29,920
You're just afraid
I'll implicate you and cost you

310
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:31,440
the Crown Prince's favor, aren't you?

311
00:20:34,800 --> 00:20:36,040
After all,

312
00:20:39,120 --> 00:20:41,080
- we both bear the surname Wei.
- You…!

313
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:50,680
My sister

314
00:20:52,120 --> 00:20:54,000
was abducted by bandits.

315
00:20:55,280 --> 00:20:56,720
Fortunately, Heaven took pity on her.

316
00:20:57,320 --> 00:21:00,200
Their hideout caught fire,
and she escaped with her life.

317
00:21:01,280 --> 00:21:03,360
A kind soul then brought her to my estate.

318
00:21:05,320 --> 00:21:08,960
Your Highness, be sure to remember that.

319
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:12,920
Don't go telling people otherwise.

320
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:17,520
You can see yourself out.

321
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:43,400
I'm fine. Don't worry about me.

322
00:21:45,760 --> 00:21:46,880
Do you remember

323
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:51,440
how we stabbed the Crown Prince
before we left?

324
00:22:11,440 --> 00:22:12,400
What I did

325
00:22:14,600 --> 00:22:15,880
was not solely to avenge you.

326
00:22:18,800 --> 00:22:21,240
When I looked at him, I suddenly thought

327
00:22:22,600 --> 00:22:26,280
how can a country
be entrusted to someone like him?

328
00:22:28,040 --> 00:22:31,080
How can the people
accept someone so depraved as their ruler?

329
00:22:32,680 --> 00:22:33,720
No, it can't happen.

330
00:22:35,320 --> 00:22:36,680
Absolutely not.

331
00:22:41,360 --> 00:22:42,680
So don't be afraid.

332
00:22:43,840 --> 00:22:46,000
With such leverage over the Crown Prince,

333
00:22:46,640 --> 00:22:49,520
he will be a hundred, a thousand times
more fearful than we.

334
00:22:50,680 --> 00:22:54,480
He has far more reason to fear
the matter becoming known to the world.

335
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:58,760
If I were him,

336
00:23:00,120 --> 00:23:04,320
I'd make everyone in his household
keep their mouths tightly shut.

337
00:23:05,280 --> 00:23:07,200
After all,
the Emperor still has three sons.

338
00:23:07,800 --> 00:23:09,640
But the Crown Prince will never have one.

339
00:23:21,040 --> 00:23:22,720
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

340
00:23:22,800 --> 00:23:23,960
What?

341
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:25,640
Marry Noble Lady Wu'an again?

342
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:29,400
Yes. That's exactly what I intend.

343
00:23:29,920 --> 00:23:31,840
Mother, as the saying goes,

344
00:23:31,920 --> 00:23:34,280
"A broken bond is hard to mend,
and spilled water can't be recovered."

345
00:23:34,360 --> 00:23:37,360
Both families are noble and respectable.

346
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:41,760
First they demand a divorce,
then they want to marry again.

347
00:23:41,840 --> 00:23:43,800
Won't that make us look like a joke?

348
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:47,720
And you, Wanniang,
should keep your son in line.

349
00:23:47,800 --> 00:23:50,200
Marriage is not something to take lightly.

350
00:23:50,280 --> 00:23:53,160
If Rao is willing to be
my daughter-in-law again,

351
00:23:53,240 --> 00:23:56,120
I'd be delighted. Why should I stop them?

352
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:58,160
You're being foolish.

353
00:23:58,240 --> 00:24:00,320
Wei Rao is no longer
that demure young lady.

354
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:04,920
I hear Zhuyu Estate has a private army
with strong men and fine horses.

355
00:24:05,000 --> 00:24:07,160
One word from her,
and they all obey. Such power!

356
00:24:07,240 --> 00:24:08,800
The Crown Prince and Prince Fu
vie to win her over.

357
00:24:08,880 --> 00:24:10,920
Princes and noblemen flock to her.

358
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:13,480
If you bring such an exalted figure
into our household,

359
00:24:13,560 --> 00:24:15,240
aren't you asking for misery?

360
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:17,400
Stop making veiled accusations.

361
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:19,840
She shelters refugees,
saves countless lives.

362
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:23,800
Grateful for her kindness,
the people even built her a living shrine.

363
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:25,320
What extraordinary merit this is!

364
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:27,440
Her name will go down in history.

365
00:24:28,080 --> 00:24:31,080
If such a woman joins the Lu family,
we'll share in that honor.

366
00:24:32,600 --> 00:24:34,760
I'm only thinking
of what's best for our family.

367
00:24:36,120 --> 00:24:38,320
She keeps a male lover at that estate.

368
00:24:38,400 --> 00:24:40,120
Did you know that?

369
00:24:40,200 --> 00:24:41,800
Utter nonsense!

370
00:24:42,520 --> 00:24:45,600
All these malicious rumors
are deliberate slander from noble families

371
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:46,760
for land and profit.

372
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:49,200
Why don't you visit Zhuyu Estate yourself?

373
00:24:49,280 --> 00:24:52,960
Every decent houses have been torn down
for granaries and fields.

374
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:55,520
It is all about saving lives.

375
00:24:56,200 --> 00:24:59,840
Those who slander her behind her back
are the real bandits and harlots.

376
00:25:00,520 --> 00:25:01,520
What did you say?

377
00:25:03,360 --> 00:25:06,280
- Who are you calling bandits and harlots?
- How dare you!

378
00:25:06,360 --> 00:25:07,840
I'm talking about someone insolent!

379
00:25:07,920 --> 00:25:08,800
Then it's you!

380
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:10,080
- Enough.
- Say no more.

381
00:25:10,160 --> 00:25:11,320
- Enough.
- Say no more.

382
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:13,040
- I'm talking about you!
- Don't argue.

383
00:25:13,120 --> 00:25:13,960
Don't upset Mother.

384
00:25:14,040 --> 00:25:15,160
- Be quiet!
- It is you!

385
00:25:15,240 --> 00:25:17,120
- All of you, be quiet!
- Yes, you!

386
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:18,400
Say no more.

387
00:25:18,480 --> 00:25:20,360
This is disgraceful!

388
00:25:21,520 --> 00:25:22,360
Mother,

389
00:25:23,320 --> 00:25:27,080
the Lu family has always been
loyal, brave, and upright.

390
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:30,480
A woman so fond of public attention
and so brazen in her conduct

391
00:25:30,560 --> 00:25:33,840
really isn't fit to join our family.

392
00:25:35,880 --> 00:25:39,160
Aunts, take such an interest
in my marriage?

393
00:25:40,680 --> 00:25:42,320
Why not ask what I think first?

394
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:47,360
You're just in time.

395
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:49,320
We're discussing your marriage.

396
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:51,320
You ought to hear what we have to say.

397
00:25:52,800 --> 00:25:54,480
Aunts, you were just saying

398
00:25:54,560 --> 00:25:56,240
someone's spreading lies
to smearHer Ladyship.

399
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:58,480
Don't they value their necks?

400
00:25:58,560 --> 00:26:02,800
I'd like to know
who had the nerve to do that.

401
00:26:04,320 --> 00:26:06,240
They're only rumors from the streets.

402
00:26:06,320 --> 00:26:07,680
You can't take them seriously.

403
00:26:07,760 --> 00:26:09,440
We were only making conversation.

404
00:26:10,280 --> 00:26:11,800
Zhuyu Estate houses more than refugees,

405
00:26:12,480 --> 00:26:14,080
but also wandering warriors.

406
00:26:14,600 --> 00:26:17,160
Wagging tongues
bring calamity upon oneself.

407
00:26:17,240 --> 00:26:18,320
Arrows from the shadows have no eyes.

408
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:21,520
Aunts, you'd do well to remember that.

409
00:26:22,120 --> 00:26:24,280
We're your elders.

410
00:26:25,360 --> 00:26:27,360
How can you speak to us like that?

411
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:30,800
All the more reason
to conduct yourselves properly.

412
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:33,720
Lu Zhuo is kindly giving you a warning.

413
00:26:33,800 --> 00:26:37,080
You two, watch your mouths.

414
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:40,360
Yes, Mother. You're right to reprimand us.

415
00:26:41,760 --> 00:26:42,640
Mother,

416
00:26:42,720 --> 00:26:45,000
Lu Ya's old injury still hasn't healed,

417
00:26:45,080 --> 00:26:47,320
yet he's insisting
on practicing martial arts again.

418
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:49,000
I must keep an eye on him.

419
00:26:49,080 --> 00:26:50,800
Please forgive me, Mother.

420
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:53,120
I won't be able to stay and attend to you.

421
00:27:03,480 --> 00:27:05,120
I'll go and check on Lu Ya too.

422
00:27:08,920 --> 00:27:11,040
Zhuo, pay them no mind.

423
00:27:12,320 --> 00:27:16,400
Talk it over with Wei Rao
and decide when to hold the wedding.

424
00:27:17,960 --> 00:27:19,800
Who said I was going to marry Wei Rao?

425
00:27:22,320 --> 00:27:25,440
The Northern Army found her in your room,

426
00:27:25,520 --> 00:27:27,640
and the whole capital
is gossiping about it.

427
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:28,800
If you don't marry her,

428
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:31,120
people will point fingers
at us behind our backs.

429
00:27:31,200 --> 00:27:32,520
Grandmother,

430
00:27:33,560 --> 00:27:35,360
please let me decide for myself.

431
00:27:35,440 --> 00:27:37,200
Don't bring this up again.

432
00:27:37,800 --> 00:27:40,440
Thank you for granting my wish.
I'll take my leave.

433
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:43,080
I haven't granted anything!

434
00:27:43,600 --> 00:27:44,520
You may have no shame,

435
00:27:44,600 --> 00:27:46,600
- but we have a reputation to uphold!
- Mother.

436
00:27:46,680 --> 00:27:48,440
How am I supposed
to face other people now?

437
00:27:48,520 --> 00:27:50,520
- You! Come back here! Come back!
- Mother.

438
00:27:50,600 --> 00:27:52,600
- You owe me an explanation!
- Calm down.

439
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:54,280
- You…!
- Calm down, Mother.

440
00:27:54,360 --> 00:27:56,160
QIWU COURT

441
00:27:57,840 --> 00:28:00,600
The physician says
Hongxian's throat was badly burned.

442
00:28:01,240 --> 00:28:03,800
Even after treatment,
her voice will never be the same.

443
00:28:07,960 --> 00:28:08,800
I see.

444
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:10,840
Runsheng keeps demanding to see you.

445
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:13,800
He's a hopeless gambler
who refuses to change.

446
00:28:14,600 --> 00:28:16,200
Give him one bowl of plain congee a day

447
00:28:16,280 --> 00:28:18,040
and send him to work on wasteland.

448
00:28:18,120 --> 00:28:19,840
If he dares slack off,
string him up and beat him.

449
00:28:21,480 --> 00:28:22,640
Yes.

450
00:28:22,720 --> 00:28:24,600
AS THE SUN RISES

451
00:28:32,160 --> 00:28:34,000
Your Ladyship, Cheng requests an audience.

452
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:36,160
Which Cheng?

453
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:38,000
The man you brought back
from the Crown Prince's Residence.

454
00:28:41,760 --> 00:28:42,680
Let him in.

455
00:28:44,960 --> 00:28:47,200
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

456
00:28:51,680 --> 00:28:52,880
Your Ladyship had me learn bookkeeping.

457
00:28:53,480 --> 00:28:55,920
The teachers taught me
with great patience.

458
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:57,560
They said I had a talent for it
and learned quickly.

459
00:28:58,600 --> 00:29:00,440
I wanted to repay your great kindness.

460
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:04,080
After much thought,
I improved the bookkeeping method.

461
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:06,000
I've simplified it
so that income and expenses

462
00:29:06,080 --> 00:29:07,680
need only be reported every ten days.

463
00:29:07,760 --> 00:29:09,480
It'll be easier
for Your Ladyship to review.

464
00:29:10,160 --> 00:29:11,600
One of the teachers asked me
to bring this ledger

465
00:29:11,680 --> 00:29:12,520
for Your Ladyship to check.

466
00:29:13,480 --> 00:29:14,320
Let me see it.

467
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:21,960
With this method, Your Ladyship,
calculating profit and loss

468
00:29:22,040 --> 00:29:23,960
is much simpler.

469
00:29:26,440 --> 00:29:28,240
DAILY RECORD OF INCOME AND EXPENDITURES

470
00:29:42,280 --> 00:29:43,680
Grandmother, you're here.

471
00:29:44,280 --> 00:29:45,640
Why wasn't I told?

472
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:47,560
I told them not to announce me.

473
00:29:51,920 --> 00:29:54,360
I wanted to see for myself

474
00:29:54,440 --> 00:29:56,880
whether you're really hiding
a <i>mianshou</i> here.

475
00:29:57,920 --> 00:29:59,040
<i>Mianshou?</i>

476
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:03,080
Your Ladyship. Your Ladyship.

477
00:30:03,160 --> 00:30:04,960
That means a male lover.

478
00:30:06,160 --> 00:30:08,520
- What?
- A male lover.

479
00:30:11,160 --> 00:30:13,080
Since when have I kept a male lover?

480
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:14,720
Where would I find the money for that?

481
00:30:15,320 --> 00:30:16,680
He may not be one now,

482
00:30:18,480 --> 00:30:21,240
but who knows what the future holds?

483
00:30:21,840 --> 00:30:24,480
Men who live off their looks
can't be trusted.

484
00:30:24,560 --> 00:30:27,400
I'm worried you'll be blinded
by a handsome face,

485
00:30:27,480 --> 00:30:29,720
so I've come to warn you.

486
00:30:29,800 --> 00:30:32,240
- Governess Sun.
- Yes.

487
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:39,120
Set them down.

488
00:30:43,800 --> 00:30:45,280
What is this for, Grandmother?

489
00:30:46,160 --> 00:30:48,520
Lord Huo Jue was back
with his caravan yesterday.

490
00:30:48,600 --> 00:30:50,680
He heard Your Ladyship
would soon be marrying

491
00:30:50,760 --> 00:30:52,760
and feared you'd have no one around,

492
00:30:52,840 --> 00:30:55,000
so he prepared some gifts
for you in advance.

493
00:30:55,600 --> 00:30:56,480
Gifts?

494
00:30:57,360 --> 00:30:58,600
For whom?

495
00:31:00,360 --> 00:31:01,960
Pretending not to know?

496
00:31:02,040 --> 00:31:04,520
The Duke of Ying's household, of course.

497
00:31:05,120 --> 00:31:06,840
You have only two dates to choose from:

498
00:31:07,440 --> 00:31:11,080
the eighth or the sixteenth day
of the second month.

499
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:13,280
Those are the only two auspicious dates.

500
00:31:13,360 --> 00:31:14,560
Choose one.

501
00:31:20,280 --> 00:31:23,200
I just heard
this gentleman was good with figures.

502
00:31:23,840 --> 00:31:27,160
Lord Huo's caravan
could use someone with his talent.

503
00:31:29,160 --> 00:31:30,680
I only wish to serve Your Ladyship.

504
00:31:31,400 --> 00:31:33,920
Grandmother, there's no rush.

505
00:31:34,000 --> 00:31:34,920
Please let me think it over.

506
00:31:39,040 --> 00:31:42,000
Your Ladyship, Lord Lu
earned his power and standing

507
00:31:42,080 --> 00:31:44,000
by risking his life on the battlefield.

508
00:31:44,080 --> 00:31:45,920
Now people call him heartless,

509
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:47,360
and the censors accuse him
of immoral conduct.

510
00:31:47,960 --> 00:31:50,160
If you keep hesitating,

511
00:31:50,240 --> 00:31:53,040
the Lu family's honor,
built over a century, may be ruined.

512
00:31:53,760 --> 00:31:54,960
Is it that serious?

513
00:31:55,040 --> 00:31:56,720
It's settled. Take him away.

514
00:31:56,800 --> 00:31:58,240
- Attendants!
- Your Ladyship!

515
00:31:59,240 --> 00:32:00,320
Your Ladyship, save me!

516
00:32:01,120 --> 00:32:03,640
Your Ladyship! Save me!

517
00:32:04,520 --> 00:32:07,520
There's no future
in living off a woman's favor.

518
00:32:07,600 --> 00:32:10,960
With the caravan, he'll learn real skills.

519
00:32:16,480 --> 00:32:17,520
Grandmother,

520
00:32:19,080 --> 00:32:23,160
I was forced into my first marriage.
I had no choice.

521
00:32:23,840 --> 00:32:27,240
May I decide for myself the second time?

522
00:32:29,360 --> 00:32:32,600
Very well. But you have only seven days.

523
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:35,640
Decide whether you'll marry him or not
in seven days.

524
00:32:36,720 --> 00:32:37,560
I will.

525
00:32:41,040 --> 00:32:43,080
Your Ladyship,
Lady Xie requests an audience.

526
00:32:44,080 --> 00:32:45,240
Xie Hualou?

527
00:32:46,920 --> 00:32:50,640
Your Ladyship,
I know I was presumptuous today.

528
00:32:50,720 --> 00:32:52,880
Thank you for agreeing to hear me out.

529
00:32:53,400 --> 00:32:54,600
What brings you here, Lady Xie?

530
00:32:56,520 --> 00:32:57,920
My family has ordered me

531
00:32:58,800 --> 00:33:00,120
to marry Prince Fu.

532
00:33:00,960 --> 00:33:03,800
He has two secondary consorts,
countless concubines,

533
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:05,200
and children by his concubines.

534
00:33:05,280 --> 00:33:06,920
I don't want this marriage.

535
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:10,880
But even when I refused food in protest,
Grandfather wouldn't relent.

536
00:33:10,960 --> 00:33:14,200
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

537
00:33:14,280 --> 00:33:15,400
Why come to me?

538
00:33:16,160 --> 00:33:19,000
I thought if I followed all the rules
expected of a young lady

539
00:33:19,600 --> 00:33:20,960
and did as I was told,

540
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:24,320
they'd at least find me a good husband.

541
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:27,000
I never imagined it would come to this.

542
00:33:28,600 --> 00:33:31,520
Somehow, I felt compelled
to come and see you.

543
00:33:32,200 --> 00:33:33,920
To see how a woman
who defies all convention,

544
00:33:34,000 --> 00:33:36,720
who is wicked and selfish,
is living these days?

545
00:33:38,280 --> 00:33:39,680
Now you've seen it.

546
00:33:40,280 --> 00:33:41,440
You can leave satisfied.

547
00:33:45,720 --> 00:33:46,880
Your Ladyship!

548
00:33:48,280 --> 00:33:52,240
Do you remember
my personal maid, Pingxiang?

549
00:33:53,320 --> 00:33:54,680
After she was carried home that day,

550
00:33:55,280 --> 00:33:57,520
Grandfather blamed her
for encouraging me to cause trouble

551
00:33:57,600 --> 00:33:58,880
and had her beaten to death.

552
00:34:00,040 --> 00:34:02,360
I've kept this to myself all this time.

553
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:04,600
If I threw caution to the wind

554
00:34:05,120 --> 00:34:08,080
and exposed you
as the one responsible back then,

555
00:34:09,199 --> 00:34:12,440
do you think
you'd still have such a good reputation?

556
00:34:12,520 --> 00:34:15,679
<i>She's blaming me for Jundai's wrongdoing.</i>

557
00:34:17,760 --> 00:34:20,800
That's your family's affair.
It has nothing to do with me.

558
00:34:22,080 --> 00:34:25,120
If you insist on telling everyone,
that's your choice.

559
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:28,280
- Please leave.
- Your Ladyship!

560
00:34:29,280 --> 00:34:31,320
I didn't bring up the past
to threaten you.

561
00:34:31,400 --> 00:34:35,080
I came to beg you to help me.

562
00:34:35,679 --> 00:34:37,239
What are you doing? Get up.

563
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:40,040
After your divorce,

564
00:34:40,120 --> 00:34:42,199
the Duke of Ying proposed
a marriage with my family,

565
00:34:42,960 --> 00:34:45,239
but Lu Zhuo refused.

566
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:48,440
There are countless men in this world
who would ask for your hand.

567
00:34:48,520 --> 00:34:50,840
You have no shortage
of suitors besides Lord Lu.

568
00:34:50,920 --> 00:34:52,400
But in all the world,

569
00:34:52,480 --> 00:34:54,560
the only man
who can save me from Prince Fu

570
00:34:56,199 --> 00:34:57,480
is Lu Zhuo.

571
00:34:59,160 --> 00:35:01,320
All I ask is that you take pity on me.

572
00:35:02,320 --> 00:35:04,080
If you tell him you won't marry him,

573
00:35:04,680 --> 00:35:07,240
Lu Zhuo will give up and marry me.

574
00:35:12,520 --> 00:35:13,520
Your Ladyship,

575
00:35:14,040 --> 00:35:15,400
I'm not trying to compete with you.

576
00:35:16,440 --> 00:35:18,320
I don't want to marry Prince Fu.

577
00:35:18,400 --> 00:35:20,520
I don't want to spend my life in hell.

578
00:35:21,680 --> 00:35:22,680
So I'm begging you.

579
00:35:22,760 --> 00:35:25,960
Help me. Please help me.

580
00:35:28,080 --> 00:35:29,880
If your two families
truly want this marriage,

581
00:35:30,720 --> 00:35:32,280
what could an outsider
like me do about it?

582
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,920
You overestimate me.

583
00:35:35,520 --> 00:35:38,040
If you want help, ask Lu Zhuo.

584
00:35:39,160 --> 00:35:41,240
But I'm a young lady confined
to the inner chambers.

585
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:43,880
I have no proper reason
to request an audience with him.

586
00:35:43,960 --> 00:35:46,040
What else can I do?

587
00:35:49,200 --> 00:35:51,160
So you came to Zhuyu Estate today

588
00:35:53,120 --> 00:35:54,200
to see him?

589
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:57,440
Please show me kindness, Your Ladyship,

590
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:00,840
and let me see him.

591
00:36:03,120 --> 00:36:05,160
I've long since opened
Mount Yaowang to the public.

592
00:36:06,000 --> 00:36:07,640
Anyone is free to fish and hunt here.

593
00:36:08,640 --> 00:36:11,080
You can wait for him if you wish.

594
00:36:13,720 --> 00:36:16,160
Noble Lady Wu'an, thank you.

595
00:36:16,720 --> 00:36:22,920
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

596
00:36:28,040 --> 00:36:30,240
Wei Rao owes everything
to her scheming seductive mother.

597
00:36:30,320 --> 00:36:32,200
Now she thinks
she can lord it over everyone.

598
00:36:32,280 --> 00:36:33,120
CAISHU HALL

599
00:36:33,200 --> 00:36:35,800
You lowered yourself to ask for help,
yet she acted so arrogantly!

600
00:36:37,200 --> 00:36:39,360
We have no choice under the circumstances.

601
00:36:40,040 --> 00:36:43,320
Lord Lu once avoided her like the plague.

602
00:36:43,400 --> 00:36:45,160
Hasn't he also changed his attitude now?

603
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:48,920
What does Wei Rao have that I don't?

604
00:36:49,760 --> 00:36:52,080
With patience and persistence,

605
00:36:52,960 --> 00:36:55,200
I'll make him see

606
00:36:55,280 --> 00:36:58,560
who deserves to be the future mistress
of the Duke's household.

607
00:37:01,320 --> 00:37:02,240
Your Ladyship.

608
00:37:02,320 --> 00:37:03,640
‪Be careful.

609
00:37:12,480 --> 00:37:15,360
Go. Follow Xie Hualou.

610
00:37:16,680 --> 00:37:17,520
Yes.

611
00:37:50,800 --> 00:37:53,040
TRIUMPH TAVERN

612
00:37:56,240 --> 00:37:57,960
Fortunately, I was prepared.

613
00:37:58,040 --> 00:38:00,520
That cousin of mine
really is suspicious of everyone.

614
00:38:04,840 --> 00:38:06,520
Thank you, Your Highness,

615
00:38:06,600 --> 00:38:08,240
for telling me the truth
about Wei Rao's origins.

616
00:38:09,200 --> 00:38:12,120
At least now
I won't spend my whole life in ignorance.

617
00:38:14,640 --> 00:38:16,560
Turns out she's actually…

618
00:38:17,280 --> 00:38:19,120
People are blind and foolish.

619
00:38:19,720 --> 00:38:22,040
They often mistake
a fish's eye for a pearl.

620
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:26,120
You come from
an illustrious family, my dear.

621
00:38:26,200 --> 00:38:27,480
Don't torment yourself over this.

622
00:38:29,360 --> 00:38:31,200
What good is being a noblewoman?

623
00:38:32,280 --> 00:38:35,120
Prince Fu is like that. So is Lu Zhuo.

624
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:36,880
I thought

625
00:38:37,640 --> 00:38:39,600
being made to feel inferior
to a plain-looking maid

626
00:38:39,680 --> 00:38:41,680
was humiliating enough.

627
00:38:42,680 --> 00:38:48,320
I never imagined Lu Zhuo's beloved
was a night-soil woman.

628
00:38:52,200 --> 00:38:53,640
A night-soil woman.

629
00:38:55,960 --> 00:38:58,200
I prided myself on my virtue and talent.

630
00:38:58,880 --> 00:39:02,360
Yet in the end,
I've become someone no one wants.

631
00:39:03,600 --> 00:39:05,640
What have all my years of effort

632
00:39:06,560 --> 00:39:07,440
amounted to?

633
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:12,200
This world
can be so absurd you can only laugh.

634
00:39:13,080 --> 00:39:15,000
It's utterly ridiculous.

635
00:39:17,360 --> 00:39:20,920
I can't grant your family's request
to send Yi Jiang away.

636
00:39:22,200 --> 00:39:24,920
Lady Wang personally
promised my grandfather

637
00:39:25,000 --> 00:39:26,560
that she'd send that maid away.

638
00:39:27,080 --> 00:39:28,840
You favor Yi Jiang alone

639
00:39:28,920 --> 00:39:31,880
and even had a secondary consort beaten
because of her.

640
00:39:33,000 --> 00:39:34,720
I hear her face is pockmarked.

641
00:39:35,960 --> 00:39:39,520
May I ask, Your Highness,
in what way am I inferior to her?

642
00:39:41,240 --> 00:39:44,000
Yi Jiang is plain and unremarkable,

643
00:39:44,960 --> 00:39:46,720
but she came to my household at seven.

644
00:39:47,320 --> 00:39:49,920
When I caught smallpox,
she nursed me day and night without rest,

645
00:39:50,000 --> 00:39:51,400
and that's why.

646
00:39:52,080 --> 00:39:53,920
Now that her youth is fading,

647
00:39:54,440 --> 00:39:55,560
I can't abandon her.

648
00:39:56,640 --> 00:39:59,800
If you marry into my household,
treat her kindly.

649
00:40:00,320 --> 00:40:01,200
Don't bully her.

650
00:40:03,080 --> 00:40:04,640
You've deeply insulted me, Your Highness.

651
00:40:05,240 --> 00:40:06,200
Show him out.

652
00:40:12,920 --> 00:40:14,200
I'm ashamed to say this,

653
00:40:14,800 --> 00:40:16,440
but Wei Rao was never properly brought up.

654
00:40:16,520 --> 00:40:17,440
She has coarse manners

655
00:40:18,520 --> 00:40:20,880
and has even openly
questioned your virtue.

656
00:40:20,960 --> 00:40:22,120
She even said…

657
00:40:24,160 --> 00:40:25,000
What did she say?

658
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:30,040
When she heard that a fortune-teller
read your face when you were three

659
00:40:30,120 --> 00:40:31,920
and foretold a future
of unimaginable nobility,

660
00:40:32,000 --> 00:40:34,360
she laughed and said…

661
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:39,760
She said, "Girls of noble birth

662
00:40:40,280 --> 00:40:41,920
are just voiceless parrots
raised in grand mansions,

663
00:40:42,600 --> 00:40:44,600
and clay figures
and wooden puppets wrapped in silk."

664
00:40:50,840 --> 00:40:53,880
Your Highness,
no need to provoke me like this.

665
00:40:55,200 --> 00:40:57,400
I do have an old score to settle with her.

666
00:40:57,480 --> 00:40:59,560
You have your mother's death
to avenge too.

667
00:41:00,160 --> 00:41:02,480
How do you want me to help you?

668
00:41:02,560 --> 00:41:06,720
But let me be clear.
Murder, arson, framing people,

669
00:41:06,800 --> 00:41:10,680
or anything that disgraces the Xie family
is absolutely off the table.

670
00:41:11,280 --> 00:41:15,240
<i>You want me to punish Wei Rao for you</i>
<i>while you keep your own good name?</i>

671
00:41:15,320 --> 00:41:16,360
<i>How greedy you are.</i>

672
00:41:17,880 --> 00:41:20,880
Lady Li and her daughter
are determined to back Liu Shuo,

673
00:41:20,960 --> 00:41:22,920
and they've gained Lu Zhuo's support too.

674
00:41:24,720 --> 00:41:27,840
Please put in a good word
for the Crown Prince

675
00:41:27,920 --> 00:41:29,640
with Grand Tutor Xie.

676
00:41:30,280 --> 00:41:31,680
The Grand Tutor is deeply respected.

677
00:41:31,760 --> 00:41:33,920
With him holding firm at court,

678
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:35,320
I believe that wicked
Lady Li and her daughter

679
00:41:36,200 --> 00:41:37,800
won't dare act so arrogantly.

680
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:44,360
HONGXIAN

681
00:41:45,880 --> 00:41:47,040
Lost track of Xie Hualou?

682
00:41:47,960 --> 00:41:50,840
Perhaps she noticed something
and deliberately sent me away.

683
00:41:50,920 --> 00:41:51,960
Please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

684
00:42:01,160 --> 00:42:03,240
You're asking why
I'm suspicious of Xie Hualou?

685
00:42:05,480 --> 00:42:07,280
Xie Hualou and I are different.

686
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:09,080
Her grandfather is a renowned scholar.

687
00:42:09,800 --> 00:42:10,840
He taught her

688
00:42:10,920 --> 00:42:13,160
loyalty, filial duty
and a woman's proper conduct.

689
00:42:13,880 --> 00:42:15,040
Plenty of young nobles in the capital

690
00:42:15,120 --> 00:42:19,080
keep maids and concubines before marriage
and father children out of wedlock.

691
00:42:19,600 --> 00:42:21,320
Besides, Prince Fu is the Emperor's son.

692
00:42:21,400 --> 00:42:25,040
A royal household full of concubines
is nothing unusual to the great families.

693
00:42:25,720 --> 00:42:28,000
Yet Xie Hualou is strongly opposed to it.

694
00:42:28,960 --> 00:42:34,120
Prince Fu must have some other flaw,

695
00:42:34,920 --> 00:42:37,320
one that even a lady like her,
so educated and proper,

696
00:42:37,400 --> 00:42:39,880
so gentle and virtuous, cannot tolerate.

697
00:42:48,480 --> 00:42:50,880
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

698
00:42:56,120 --> 00:42:57,920
QIWU COURT

699
00:42:59,560 --> 00:43:01,000
Hongxian!

700
00:43:23,800 --> 00:43:24,880
The weather's turning.

701
00:43:25,520 --> 00:43:27,520
Grandmother's rheumatism
will probably worsen.

702
00:43:28,040 --> 00:43:29,400
Have the carriage prepared.

703
00:43:29,480 --> 00:43:31,160
Head to Earl of Cheng'an's Residence
to visit her.

704
00:43:42,680 --> 00:43:44,680
<i>I gave her seven days.</i>

705
00:43:44,760 --> 00:43:47,840
<i>We'll know her decision soon enough.</i>

706
00:43:47,920 --> 00:43:48,760
My Lord.

707
00:43:48,840 --> 00:43:51,440
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

708
00:43:51,520 --> 00:43:52,880
You're back, My Lord.

709
00:43:53,480 --> 00:43:54,880
The Duke just returned from the barracks.

710
00:43:54,960 --> 00:43:56,200
He heard how you and General Qi
forced your way into the residence

711
00:43:56,280 --> 00:43:58,120
and demands you see him
in his study at once.

712
00:44:01,000 --> 00:44:03,560
- Still no word?
- What do you mean, My Lord?

713
00:44:15,600 --> 00:44:18,920
What awful weather! Why is it snowing now?

714
00:44:19,000 --> 00:44:20,240
Is this a spring cold snap?

715
00:44:22,120 --> 00:44:23,200
Something's wrong.

716
00:44:24,880 --> 00:44:27,240
Tell Grandfather I'll see him later.

717
00:44:27,840 --> 00:44:28,680
My Lord!

718
00:44:30,120 --> 00:44:32,280
- My Lord, what am I supposed to say?
- Move!

719
00:44:32,360 --> 00:44:34,080
- My Lord!
- Stop shouting.

720
00:44:34,720 --> 00:44:36,920
- A spring cold snap could disrupt farming.
- What?

721
00:44:37,520 --> 00:44:39,200
Lord Lu is going to see Her Ladyship.

722
00:44:39,280 --> 00:44:41,240
He's been waiting for her
to give in first.

723
00:44:41,320 --> 00:44:42,600
Now that the weather has changed,

724
00:44:42,680 --> 00:44:44,120
he's found an excuse to go to her.

725
00:44:49,960 --> 00:44:55,280
HENGCHENG GATE

726
00:44:56,280 --> 00:44:58,560
Forgive me for speaking out of turn,
Your Ladyship.

727
00:44:58,640 --> 00:45:01,200
Lady Li dislikes your closeness
to the Wei family.

728
00:45:01,280 --> 00:45:02,760
You made a trip to Jiming Alley

729
00:45:02,840 --> 00:45:05,440
to buy the white rice cakes
Old Madam Wei likes.

730
00:45:05,520 --> 00:45:08,160
If Lady Li finds out,
she'll certainly be upset.

731
00:45:12,040 --> 00:45:15,000
You were staring at them earlier,
practically drooling.

732
00:45:15,080 --> 00:45:15,920
Go on and eat.

733
00:45:16,600 --> 00:45:18,400
They're for me?

734
00:45:19,720 --> 00:45:21,840
- Have some too, Your Ladyship.
- You eat.

735
00:45:21,920 --> 00:45:22,960
I bought them for you.

736
00:45:23,560 --> 00:45:25,360
We don't have all the rules between us.

737
00:45:29,280 --> 00:45:30,560
Whenever Grandmother sees me,

738
00:45:31,640 --> 00:45:33,320
it's as if she sees her beloved son,

739
00:45:33,920 --> 00:45:35,600
and her condition improves.

740
00:45:36,440 --> 00:45:37,800
When I visit her,

741
00:45:38,640 --> 00:45:39,800
I'm simply doing

742
00:45:40,920 --> 00:45:42,840
a son's duty on behalf
of the father I never knew.

743
00:45:43,800 --> 00:45:45,720
But if it weren't for Old Madam Wei,

744
00:45:45,800 --> 00:45:47,880
- you wouldn't have…
- Grandmother loves me

745
00:45:47,960 --> 00:45:50,240
because I remind her of the son she loved.

746
00:45:51,320 --> 00:45:54,880
She didn't lose me on purpose. It just…

747
00:45:57,640 --> 00:45:58,520
the love wasn't enough.

748
00:46:00,280 --> 00:46:01,720
But who in this world,

749
00:46:01,800 --> 00:46:04,480
would give me a love that's uniquely mine?

750
00:46:05,720 --> 00:46:08,760
Not Grandmother. Not Lady Li.

751
00:46:09,640 --> 00:46:12,760
If I expect less, I have less to resent.

752
00:46:15,000 --> 00:46:17,880
But you should still travel
in a manner befitting your rank.

753
00:46:17,960 --> 00:46:20,720
Such a plain carriage will make
people in the capital laugh at you.

754
00:46:22,800 --> 00:46:25,160
When you first came,
you were so stern and quiet.

755
00:46:25,240 --> 00:46:26,600
You're getting chatty, aren't you?

756
00:46:38,200 --> 00:46:41,280
‪SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

757
00:47:03,560 --> 00:47:05,760
<i>His Highness, the Crown Prince,</i>

758
00:47:05,840 --> 00:47:08,720
<i>will one day ascend the throne,</i>
<i>with the whole realm at his feet.</i>

759
00:47:08,800 --> 00:47:13,800
Wei Rao, you'll regret today's arrogance
when it's too late.

760
00:47:16,160 --> 00:47:17,360
<i>If you tell him you won't marry him,</i>

761
00:47:17,960 --> 00:47:20,560
Lu Zhuo will give up and marry me.

762
00:47:44,880 --> 00:47:47,440
The sun's been swallowed!

763
00:47:47,520 --> 00:47:50,280
What's going on?

764
00:47:50,920 --> 00:47:53,400
The sun! The sun's been swallowed!

765
00:47:53,480 --> 00:47:55,000
The gods are punishing us!

766
00:47:55,080 --> 00:47:56,760
Our country is doomed!

767
00:47:56,840 --> 00:47:58,920
Run! Something is wrong!

768
00:47:59,560 --> 00:48:01,240
The sun is disappearing!

769
00:48:01,320 --> 00:48:02,640
The gods are punishing us!

770
00:48:03,280 --> 00:48:04,520
The gods are punishing us!

771
00:48:04,600 --> 00:48:06,680
- Run!
- Run!

772
